<title>NORWAY: Dyno 1996 net profit slumps 38 pct.</title>
<headline>Dyno 1996 net profit slumps 38 pct.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December 31.</p>
<p>				 (millions of crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Operating income		9,714	vs	10,411</p>
<p> Operating profit		  460	vs	   602</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit		    373	vs	   528</p>
<p> After-tax profit		  211	vs	   343</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Norwegian explosives, chemicals and plastics group is Dyno Industrier ASA.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
